        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "First, signed order flow is a strong and highly significant predictor of both contemporaneous and one-month-ahead stock returns, robust to the inclusion of standard equity controls (size, book-to-market, momentum, and Amihud illiquidity), consistent with Proposition 3's prediction that order-flow innovations move prices in equilibrium.",
